@page "/components/input"

<PageTitle>Input — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Input</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    One element, and the reason <code>--control-h</code> exists: shadcn writes <code>h-9</code>
    literally, which pins every consumer to one control size. Everything else in the class list is
    shadcn's, unchanged.
</p>

