<h2 class="doc-h2">Required</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>required</code> is the validation: the browser refuses to submit and says why, in the
    reader's own language, before a request is made. The server checks it again, because a
    client-side rule is a convenience and never a guarantee.
</p>
<Example Source="InputRequired.razor"><InputRequired /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">File</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The form needs <code>enctype="multipart/form-data"</code> or the file is not sent — silently,
    which is the first thing to check when an upload arrives empty.
</p>
