<h2 class="doc-h2">Form</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>up-validate</code> fires the same handler with <code>X-Up-Validate</code> set. Guard the
    handler with <code>IsUpValidating()</code> before any write — Unpoly fires it on blur, and
    without the guard every blur would create a record.
</p>
